B.b0d=s(["Hey, how are you? We all got terribly worried \u2014 we even stopped digging sand!","The main thing is to breathe. The wave brought you here so you could just lie in the quiet.","Look, the eyes are open! Claws up, hooray, you're okay!","Don't rush to jump up. The sand is very warm, it will take all your tiredness.","We built a little wall against the wind so your ears don't get cold. Rest.","You overworked yourself in that forest. Even the strongest heroes sometimes just need to lie down.","Want a shell? It shines nicely and isn't heavy at all, not like your stone.","The ocean will take care of you: the waves carry tiredness away.","We'll stay close while you gather strength. Nobody will bother you here.","Well, time for us to run off on crab business. Remember: rest is part of the path too!"],t.s)
